      "content": "Kora makes \\(20\\) dishes.\n\nRory makes \\(20\\) more:\n\n\\[\n20+20=40\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\n2\\times 40=80\n\\]\n\nTogether, Jada and Rory make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
